{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your ship might be held together with duct tape and optimism, and the mission is probably a one-way trip... But someone's got to do it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deckbuilding in Real-Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Machine is a roguelike deckbuilder where the action never stops. There are no turns.  You're piloting a ship through hostile lunar tunnels, playing cards to fire weapons, raise shields, and keep your hull intact, all while threats pile up on your radar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck between encounters. Use it to survive them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/ec79d1a44c9327c549baccb3c64f9215.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/ec79d1a44c9327c549baccb3c64f9215.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/ec79d1a44c9327c549baccb3c64f9215.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Your Luck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patch Cards let you modify card effects mid-run. Roll the dice on standard card stats to create high-risk, high-reward variations. Chance a system overload for a massive damage boost.\u00a0Gamble on unstable modifications for game-changing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/79cbc028f8b154c41ca03be5d4c13449.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/79cbc028f8b154c41ca03be5d4c13449.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/79cbc028f8b154c41ca03be5d4c13449.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Moon Awakens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For eons, something has been sleeping inside the moon. Now it's waking up: A factory, alien and vast, spinning up to destroy life as we know it. You're piloting humanity's last-ditch attempt to reach the core and shut it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Ship, Your Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple ships, each with different base stats and starting decks. Upgrade your reactor, armor, and weapons as you go. Visit merchants. Make hard choices about what to take and what to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Real-time deckbuilding</strong> \u2014 Play cards in the moment, using your reflexes to take advantage of timing-based effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patch Card system</strong> \u2014 Modify cards on the fly for high-risk combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple ships</strong> \u2014 Each with distinct loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite progression</strong> \u2014 Unlock new cards and ships across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analog-future aesthetic</strong> \u2014 CRT monitors, physical gauges, and duct tape engineering </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/daa246a1ab7b77585e4cfb97398e4d9b.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/daa246a1ab7b77585e4cfb97398e4d9b.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/daa246a1ab7b77585e4cfb97398e4d9b.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good luck! We're all counting on you.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974540?t=1773317224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/9676647f0453c57fd351650778ea30206c93dc2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773317224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/af21e6e043ce689ba0833ef31b7fcfa4c17e2119/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773317224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/af21e6e043ce689ba0833ef31b7fcfa4c17e2119/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773317224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3809970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your ship might be held together with duct tape and optimism, and the mission is probably a one-way trip... But someone's got to do it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deckbuilding in Real-Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Machine is a roguelike deckbuilder where the action never stops. There are no turns.  You're piloting a ship through hostile lunar tunnels, playing cards to fire weapons, raise shields, and keep your hull intact, all while threats pile up on your radar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck between encounters. Use it to survive them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/ec79d1a44c9327c549baccb3c64f9215.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/ec79d1a44c9327c549baccb3c64f9215.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/ec79d1a44c9327c549baccb3c64f9215.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Your Luck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patch Cards let you modify card effects mid-run. Roll the dice on standard card stats to create high-risk, high-reward variations. Chance a system overload for a massive damage boost.\u00a0Gamble on unstable modifications for game-changing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/79cbc028f8b154c41ca03be5d4c13449.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/79cbc028f8b154c41ca03be5d4c13449.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/79cbc028f8b154c41ca03be5d4c13449.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Moon Awakens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For eons, something has been sleeping inside the moon. Now it's waking up: A factory, alien and vast, spinning up to destroy life as we know it. You're piloting humanity's last-ditch attempt to reach the core and shut it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Ship, Your Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple ships, each with different base stats and starting decks. Upgrade your reactor, armor, and weapons as you go. Visit merchants. Make hard choices about what to take and what to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Real-time deckbuilding</strong> \u2014 Play cards in the moment, using your reflexes to take advantage of timing-based effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patch Card system</strong> \u2014 Modify cards on the fly for high-risk combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple ships</strong> \u2014 Each with distinct loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite progression</strong> \u2014 Unlock new cards and ships across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analog-future aesthetic</strong> \u2014 CRT monitors, physical gauges, and duct tape engineering </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/daa246a1ab7b77585e4cfb97398e4d9b.poster.avif?t=1773317224\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/daa246a1ab7b77585e4cfb97398e4d9b.webm?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/daa246a1ab7b77585e4cfb97398e4d9b.mp4?t=1773317224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good luck! We're all counting on you.</h2>","developers":["Cooler Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/c367028cb8a91979b208a7b93eb6af7155d4f359/header.jpg?t=1773317224","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.5 Monterey or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5000 or Iris, Apple M1 (integrated)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2974540/455089714/31d89e0687dad3664ecc654bdb969f20481224dc/1768405327/dash_av1.m